OFFICIAL-SENSITIVE

Cumbria Fire crews evacuated Fellside in Cockermouth at 0200 as flood water entered the
ground floor. 23 residents moved to Cockermouth School. The home is run by
Fellside Care Ltd. Manager on site: Linda Bowe, 07700 900871.

NWAS assessed all residents. One resident, Mr George Tweddle (91), was taken to
CIC as a precaution.

